---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="支持开发｜PeterKit"
  description="如果 PeterKit 的工具帮到了你，欢迎支持开发中的 AI token 费用和日常维护。完全自愿，不影响工具使用。"
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <span class="brand__mark">PK</span>
      <span>PeterKit</span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="站点导航">
      <a href="/">工具目录</a>
      <a href="/faq/">常见问题</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="page page--tool support-page">
    <a class="crumb" href="/">← 工具目录</a>

    <header class="tool-head">
      <p class="support-eyebrow">一点支持，慢慢做好。</p>
      <h1>请开发者喝杯咖啡</h1>
      <p class="tool-head__desc">如果这些工具帮你省下了一点时间，欢迎支持它们继续更新。<br />金额随意，心意就好。谢谢你愿意来这里看看。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="support-purpose" aria-labelledby="purpose-h">
      <h2 id="purpose-h">支持会用在哪里？</h2>
      <p>开发和测试会消耗 AI token，也需要时间修复问题、适配网站、整理使用说明。你的支持会用于这些开发费用和日常维护。</p>
      <p class="support-promise">完全自愿，不影响任何工具的下载和使用。这不是订阅，也不会解锁额外功能或提供 AI 接口额度。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="support-payment" aria-labelledby="payment-h">
      <div>
        <h2 id="payment-h">随心支持</h2>
        <p>收款方式准备中，暂未开放打赏。</p>
        <p class="support-payment__note">现在不需要支付任何费用。工具照常免费使用。</p>
      </div>
      <span class="support-payment__thanks" aria-hidden="true">谢谢你的心意 : )</span>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="other-h">
      <h2 id="other-h">不打赏，也是一种支持</h2>
      <p class="section-body">把工具分享给需要的朋友、认真反馈一个问题，或者在 GitHub 上点一颗 Star，都很有帮助。</p>
      <div class="support-actions">
        <a class="button" href="https://github.com/TshyGO/tools" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">去 GitHub 看看 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="support-feedback" href="https://github.com/TshyGO/tools/issues" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">反馈问题</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <span>MIT · 开源</span>
    <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
      <a href="/support/" aria-current="page">支持开发</a>
      <a href="/">工具目录</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/TshyGO/tools" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
    </nav>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .support-page { flex: 1; }
  .support-eyebrow { margin: 8px 0 16px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 13px; }
  .support-page .tool-head { padding-bottom: 32px; }
  .support-page .tool-head h1 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .support-purpose p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .support-purpose .support-promise { margin-top: 14px; }
  .support-page .support-payment {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .support-payment h2 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .support-payment p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .support-payment .support-payment__note { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
  .support-payment__thanks { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .support-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px 24px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .support-feedback { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
